    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0024",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s02-p037-01920-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Stephen Dedalus in James Joyce’s A Portrait of the Artist as a Young Man also chooses the life of aesthetics over virtue.",
      "sentenceSha256": "6f7ac641c8a0c8ad335fdb1f62ca9b3b93068c06e2db2f1ff4dc8356c485b45c",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s02-p037-01920-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-012",
      "parentFingerprint": "8d97e7b106c71512065443d97a6d7cc685fb9fcd5e7dbbc63b9ca666447bf140",
      "passageSha256": "3839b8abc83ee1713800189ba81ac5a67dd0c2c055ad60d6463ea07c9c5d81d1",
      "pdfPages": [
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0025",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s02-p037-01920-s005",
      "sentenceText": "There are characters like Stephen Dedalus in numerous works of literature, ranging from Homer’s Odyssey and Cervantes’s Don Quixote to Voltaire’s Candide and Melville’s Moby-Dick to Lewis Carroll’s Alice’s Adventures in Wonderland and Toni Morrison’s Sula.",
      "sentenceSha256": "ca30e0a6f093ef9dac9f3b8557a0b1e7c1733882666906854d7372c01d7196e8",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s02-p037-01920-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-013",
      "parentFingerprint": "53802cf20dcbf0afa49dc3c509628e9445e88880a062badb14ee8c93fae5049f",
      "passageSha256": "ce99861aa69ef288b4dde0c7a5323ab2c974225ea12c3dd705f955a9013469b1",
      "pdfPages": [
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0026",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s02-p037-01920-s006",
      "sentenceText": "At key moments, the main characters in these novels embrace uncertainty over certainty, freedom over security, and self-expression over duty, ultimately choosing to go rather than to stay.",
      "sentenceSha256": "e6113652c11b298d41186cf449652a8123631970181d9f6ed2affbd09fa1b7b8",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s02-p037-01920-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-013",
      "parentFingerprint": "53802cf20dcbf0afa49dc3c509628e9445e88880a062badb14ee8c93fae5049f",
      "passageSha256": "ce99861aa69ef288b4dde0c7a5323ab2c974225ea12c3dd705f955a9013469b1",
      "pdfPages": [
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0027",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s03-p037-05160-s001",
      "sentenceText": "In a 2015 Atlantic essay, Alison Gopnik, a world-famous professor of psychology at UC Berkeley, wrote, “In 2006, I was 50—I was falling apart.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "c3110967844b7163eb4d066afc91c54a1a0ace13b117a03d7f3edb1d0d4628a9",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s03-p037-05160-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-015",
      "parentFingerprint": "a2cd1de8aec267a31006627eefa27e4d8599d00d3ced9811ff77cb9f670cc86e",
      "passageSha256": "de5753c270575037a74d1039370c6656f2e92a743cda1757a2809ef215b368f7",
      "pdfPages": [
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0028",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s03-p037-05160-s004",
      "sentenceText": "It was then that she discovered she liked women.",
      "sentenceSha256": "4335b158a27387e917386c3a981e8bbe8b85ef3cdd26722c91704591ea649720",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s03-p037-05160-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-015",
      "parentFingerprint": "a2cd1de8aec267a31006627eefa27e4d8599d00d3ced9811ff77cb9f670cc86e",
      "passageSha256": "de5753c270575037a74d1039370c6656f2e92a743cda1757a2809ef215b368f7",
      "pdfPages": [
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0029",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s03-p037-05160-s005",
      "sentenceText": "When her love affair with a woman ended, however, depression set in: “Everything that had defined me was gone.",
      "sentenceSha256": "c9570a2b95f57496fcb780f6df06681eaba7f2dfd434ec58e5bac612cfdcaa19",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s03-p037-05160-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-016",
      "parentFingerprint": "70bbdb5ab51f7595c0b10e17363842c921c935ed701cc58aa666cc56cb4eb6cd",
      "passageSha256": "6bff45ff9959c9b6a52f937962d142ed288ca339a325f37f5db2c06c16d17c15",
      "pdfPages": [
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0030",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s03-p037-05160-s006",
      "sentenceText": "I was no longer a scientist or a philosopher or a wife or a mother or a lover.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "c860e6c804b71d46eef6db074828e46b54d796e937313721a01f43f4d8c6bf9f",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s03-p037-05160-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-016",
      "parentFingerprint": "70bbdb5ab51f7595c0b10e17363842c921c935ed701cc58aa666cc56cb4eb6cd",
      "passageSha256": "6bff45ff9959c9b6a52f937962d142ed288ca339a325f37f5db2c06c16d17c15",
      "pdfPages": [
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0031",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s03-p038-00750-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Gopnik’s newfound interest in Buddhism provoked a question, one that would lead her down an Alice in Wonderland–esque intellectual rabbit hole.",
      "sentenceSha256": "75bd0596a760a8b0f86e5124b10e04837b03f85e180a4fa396e30588d312d271",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s03-p038-00750-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-017",
      "parentFingerprint": "a6125a14baacf9e82a8890a7401144618a5b6ed8ba54d50f0d747e9ef192aaa5",
      "passageSha256": "51665c67ae8c7f9d039ff55fe54f04c90a0fe962bb4c94cf4b2ca71ae9f9babd",
      "pdfPages": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0032",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s03-p038-00750-s003",
      "sentenceText": "So began her quest to link Ippolito Desideri, a Jesuit missionary to Tibet who wrote about Buddhism in 1728, with David Hume, who completed his Treatise in 1738.",
      "sentenceSha256": "314ce545fae74ec323bf96fc743392ddcb0ba364e8f00545fc4a9f7323617671",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s03-p038-00750-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-017",
      "parentFingerprint": "a6125a14baacf9e82a8890a7401144618a5b6ed8ba54d50f0d747e9ef192aaa5",
      "passageSha256": "51665c67ae8c7f9d039ff55fe54f04c90a0fe962bb4c94cf4b2ca71ae9f9babd",
      "pdfPages": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0033",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s03-p038-02700-s002",
      "sentenceText": "She also learned that La Flèche was home to the Jesuit Royal College.",
      "sentenceSha256": "210ca33a4498f281adf4f5636c12728c7c50710ea9e960650e5f328fbc05e187",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s03-p038-02700-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-019",
      "parentFingerprint": "9fd640214274e67a6c76e4de71145a94ae3930df8b6a0edf2627ed0ad89aa1da",
      "passageSha256": "60e8a90adb42805ce85d8879aa02d41a6b03cc1782043ab366aa4eb034396527",
      "pdfPages": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0034",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s03-p038-02700-s003",
      "sentenceText": "Had Ippolito Desideri lived at the Jesuit Royal College around that time?",
      "sentenceSha256": "cdeb5fa59f448ea241c36d8d7c64b28097987f27f628502df9e80794f6d8b0b8",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s03-p038-02700-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-019",
      "parentFingerprint": "9fd640214274e67a6c76e4de71145a94ae3930df8b6a0edf2627ed0ad89aa1da",
      "passageSha256": "60e8a90adb42805ce85d8879aa02d41a6b03cc1782043ab366aa4eb034396527",
      "pdfPages": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0035",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s03-p038-02700-s004",
      "sentenceText": "By the time she started grappling with this question, she found herself looking forward to tomorrow for the first time since her depressive episode.",
      "sentenceSha256": "b281c2b304a3ee2db910ae1af26a09025a3db5da8ba611911b8a7baf66943565",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s03-p038-02700-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-019",
      "parentFingerprint": "9fd640214274e67a6c76e4de71145a94ae3930df8b6a0edf2627ed0ad89aa1da",
      "passageSha256": "60e8a90adb42805ce85d8879aa02d41a6b03cc1782043ab366aa4eb034396527",
      "pdfPages": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0036",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s03-p038-03870-s001",
      "sentenceText": "The life of Ippolito Desideri proved to be mysterious, and Gopnik’s questions about Desideri were far more difficult to answer than those about Hume.",
      "sentenceSha256": "7743ad0b990921311f34feb50ed3f09e3e906c51780794ef49d75c4506ed5f2e",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s03-p038-03870-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-020",
      "parentFingerprint": "0edc5e7e7d27b311058d0c746123c2ccfd9b4fa418a946017f23a32eed3b4133",
      "passageSha256": "87e0bddcc5433a006796fe61a52942cd857949f7616ab95ed513f3e63c5a2718",
      "pdfPages": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0037",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s03-p038-03870-s002",
      "sentenceText": "She went on sabbatical in 2007 and spent it at Caltech, where she met an expert in the history of seventeenth- and eighteenth-century Jesuits.",
      "sentenceSha256": "135a099f46548493d0b9882af67ab723d69904a084924f3de57c83d115a52b05",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s03-p038-03870-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-020",
      "parentFingerprint": "0edc5e7e7d27b311058d0c746123c2ccfd9b4fa418a946017f23a32eed3b4133",
      "passageSha256": "87e0bddcc5433a006796fe61a52942cd857949f7616ab95ed513f3e63c5a2718",
      "pdfPages": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0038",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s03-p038-03870-s005",
      "sentenceText": "On her last day in Rome, she learned that Desideri had visited the Royal College again when David Hume was there.",
      "sentenceSha256": "dd038b54c355ef43f7bff1de54f66f2b993ec0ea3e10a5177c51e0d7d5207243",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s03-p038-03870-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-021",
      "parentFingerprint": "7326260c14342ff3d8ac6a874e45b86b42b8271d956ed72bcae4eb480e261369",
      "passageSha256": "024b2efaf4b63cc5c76a90a28073ce6583dd6b03fc8362653133c8d9cd054d5c",
      "pdfPages": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0039",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s03-p038-03870-s007",
      "sentenceText": "Her question was answered: David Hume must have read about Buddhism in La Flèche.",
      "sentenceSha256": "9efec8af2bd46da4ebe1cc612ed70551bd60ee8819ae3321136748b7eb84205c",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s03-p038-03870-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-021",
      "parentFingerprint": "7326260c14342ff3d8ac6a874e45b86b42b8271d956ed72bcae4eb480e261369",
      "passageSha256": "024b2efaf4b63cc5c76a90a28073ce6583dd6b03fc8362653133c8d9cd054d5c",
      "pdfPages": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0040",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s03-p038-03870-s008",
      "sentenceText": "She had connected Eastern philosophy to the Western Enlightenment.",
      "sentenceSha256": "03e32c32aec9c771d515c22306673ac940abc21cc113861e82e20cfada0a9bc8",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s03-p038-03870-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-021",
      "parentFingerprint": "7326260c14342ff3d8ac6a874e45b86b42b8271d956ed72bcae4eb480e261369",
      "passageSha256": "024b2efaf4b63cc5c76a90a28073ce6583dd6b03fc8362653133c8d9cd054d5c",
      "pdfPages": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0041",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s03-p038-06015-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Gopnik ends her Atlantic article by saying: “Once again, I was an exceptionally fortunate and happy woman, full of irrational exuberance and everyday joy.",
      "sentenceSha256": "521fe4531e7a97ec47ea587e145f6d867607418182020e1403ee7a9343c0ab99",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s03-p038-06015-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-022",
      "parentFingerprint": "6b4a23bbff08dd73b366ef8ce431aa10c02191cd9beb23a75b380744d8b30776",
      "passageSha256": "c6e7abb74184217a1825e73b8658235fbb6b2292e96ca82f2a2a60c4a91ff072",
      "pdfPages": [
        38,
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0042",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s03-p038-06015-s002",
      "sentenceText": "But that’s not all I was.",
      "sentenceSha256": "046fee50acd149006ff6543a14e5f6f4167efc506e305951a98825692e34dd74",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s03-p038-06015-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-022",
      "parentFingerprint": "6b4a23bbff08dd73b366ef8ce431aa10c02191cd9beb23a75b380744d8b30776",
      "passageSha256": "c6e7abb74184217a1825e73b8658235fbb6b2292e96ca82f2a2a60c4a91ff072",
      "pdfPages": [
        38,
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0043",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s03-p039-01140-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Gopnik faced a loss of happiness and meaning in her time of crisis.",
      "sentenceSha256": "5ebd0ed84a218a4cf1c90e6dd16fc9afebe5c53d2b9bff8d06a7bd7de0243b79",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s03-p039-01140-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-023",
      "parentFingerprint": "ecb52baa25da39c0070a2afe56b89f0fda9cff7332b7a4ad5d7ccd6ad65959dc",
      "passageSha256": "fd56a0a5273a76aac1bc89d883d606c2dd0d5374a4e0185f4d1a4491dfe6fdb4",
      "pdfPages": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c04-0044",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s03-p039-01140-s002",
      "sentenceText": "But all was not lost.",
      "sentenceSha256": "21a9f7b8e6a50886fd2788049ef7c30df43a92fc0919ae164179e17befa82482",
      "readingUnitId": "c04-s03-p039-01140-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c04-023",
